OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for information
OL,4,Aafter masked man spotted attempting to
OL,5,Afire crossbow at PSNI station
OL,6,
OL,7,FArmed response units were deployed
OL,8,Falongside local policing officers after
OL,9,Fa man was seen brandishing a crossbow
OL,10,Fin Belfast city centre.
OL,12,FPolice said the incident in Durham
OL,13,FStreet was reported at about 02:40 GMT
OL,14,Fon Friday, but "the suspect had fled
OL,15,Fthe area prior to their arrival".
OL,17,FThey said that the crossbow has since
OL,18,Fbeen recovered along with a crossbow
OL,19,Fbolt and a face covering.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
