OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for information
OL,4,Aafter masked man spotted attempting to
OL,5,Afire crossbow at PSNI station
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt "would appear an attempt was made to
OL,8,Fdischarge the bolt at the police
OL,9,Fstation on Grosvenor Road", the Police
OL,10,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)
OL,11,Fadded.
